 finalized once checkout is completed.\\n    </p>\\n    \\n    <p>\\n        Placing a bid on any ${shopify.value.shop.name} Auction item is a binding commitment to purchase and own that item. ${shopify.value.shop.name} is <strong>not responsible</strong> for any post-sale trading, gifting, or swapping of auction items between customers.\\n    </p>\\n    \\n    <p>\\n        In the rare event that an auction item arrives with a defect or is not as described, ${shopify.value.shop.name} will provide a complimentary repair or issue a refund. Quality concerns must be reported promptly and will be evaluated on a case-by-case basis.\\n    </p>\\n</div>`}}\",\"style\":{\"data\":{\"strong_color\":\"colors.secondary\",\"strong_typography\":{\"data\":{\"_inherit\":\"typography.body\",\"fontSize\":16,\"lineHeight\":24},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"},\"p_typography\":{\"data\":{\"_inherit\":\"typography.body\",\"fontSize\":13,\"lineHeight\":19.5},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"},\"strong_paddingRight\":\"4\",\"strong_paddingLeft\":\"4\"},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"}},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableMap\",\"__postDeserialize__\":\"\"},\"layout\":{\"data\":{\"container\":\"tile1::termsOfServiceCtn\",\"__flexProperties\":{}},\"__serializedType__\":\"ImmutableRecord\",\"__serializedRef__\":4},\"namespace\":{\"namespace\":[\"tile1\"],\"pluginId\":\"termsOfServiceRichText\"},\"analytics\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"animations\":{\"$jsan\":\"u\"},\"_modelStyles\":{\"strong_color\":\"#b57559\",\"strong_typography\":{\"fontFamily\":\"AlbertSans-Light\",\"fontSize\":16,\"letterSpacing\":0,\"lineHeight\":24,\"textTransform\":\"none\",\"textDecorationLine\":\"none\"},\"p_typography\":{\"fontFamily\":\"AlbertSans-Light\",\"fontSize\":13,\"letterSpacing\":0,\"lineHeight\":19.5,\"textTransform\":\"none\",\"textDecorationLine\":\"none\"},\"strong_paddingRight\":4,\"strong_paddingLeft